      "readme_excerpt": "# Family Tree\n\nA full-stack application for building, managing, and visualizing family trees. Built with a modern tech stack featuring a NestJS backend API and a React frontend.\n\n## 🎬 Demo\n\n![Demo](assets/demo.gif)\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- **User Authentication & Authorization** - Secure login and role-based access control\n- **Family Tree Management** - Create, edit, and manage family tree structures\n- **Family Members** - Add and manage detailed person profiles\n- **Relationships** - Define and visualize different types of family relationships\n- **Visual Canvas** - Interactive visualization of family trees using graph layouts\n- **Multi-language Support** - Internationalization (I18n) support for multiple languages\n- **Collaboration** - Collaboration features for shared family trees\n- **GEDCOM Support** - Import/export family tree data in GEDCOM format\n- **Search** - Powerful search across family members and trees\n- **Notifications** - Real-time notifications and updates\n- **Media Management** - Upload and manage photos and media files\n- **Blog/Articles** - Share family stories and articles\n- **Admin Dashboard** - Administrative tools and management interface\n\n## 📋 Prerequisites\n\n- **Node.",
